@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
    usecase "View availability" as UC1
    usecase "Book room" as UC2
    usecase "Cancel booking" as UC3
    usecase "Send confirmation" as UC4
    usecase "Review usage" as UC5
    usecase "Block or unblock room" as UC6

    ' why: R4 and US-04 require confirmation after every successful booking.
    UC2 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3

Administrator --> UC5
Administrator --> UC6

note bottom of UC3
    Students can cancel only their own bookings.
    Source: scenario and US-03.
end note

note bottom of UC4
    Confirmation is produced only after
    a successful booking (R4, US-04).
end note

@enduml